id: pm-linear-schema-drift
title: Refuse Linear sync when negotiated workflow schema drifts
description: "Inspect Linear custom states, labels and team settings before local sync writes. Emit a versioned mapping compatibility report through the typed SDK and CLI."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: changed,linear,schema
created_at: "2026-10-22T15:20:15.967Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T23:11:54.517Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T21:46:43.711Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-22T21:08:51.000Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Deleted labels and renamed states invalidate old plans; Missing permissions fail before local changes; Compact TOON/JSON report, remedies, docs and no-git real-data validation"
resolution: "Negotiates labels/states/permissions and refuses stale workflow plans before local mutation, with compact outputs, remedies and real no-git validation."
expected_result: "Deleted labels and renamed states invalidate old plans; Missing permissions fail before local changes; Compact TOON/JSON report, remedies, docs and no-git real-data validation"
actual_result: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/163, merged 2026-10-22T21:08:51Z, merge 28d283198947324937c9257d02a992cd6ac4b4f7: Negotiates labels/states/permissions and refuses stale workflow plans before local mutation, with compact outputs, remedies and real no-git validation."
comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T15:20:20.235Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check rerun: the pinned core SDK schemaList/schemaShowStatus model local types and statuses; neither negotiates provider metadata. Sibling pm-jira maps Jira workflow categories and field projections; pm-ado owns Azure fields and revision checks. Their provider metadata is not reusable for Linear. Existing linear validate probes configuration/viewer only. Reuse the runtime SDK loader, certified listAllComplete reads, schemaList, registered command/flags and existing atomic commitItemMutations path. Add deterministic provider/local mapping version and mandatory read-only metadata gate before sync writes; recheck after issue fetch. No provider writes are needed."
  "2026-10-22T15:28:38.270Z",codex-agent,"Implemented typed negotiation and refusal contracts, a native linear schema command, and schema-version on sync/native/legacy import. Mandatory live sync discovery covers paginated workflow states and team/workspace labels, settings, local status definitions and overrides; a second discovery precedes writes. Reports contain counts, exact state mapping preview (32 rows maximum), omission count and label digest, never issue bodies. Existing transport fixtures now serve metadata separately so issue and export regressions retain their transport assertions. CI adds explicit npm and Bun release-gate jobs at existing thresholds. Local typecheck and docstring lint pass; targeted fault controls and real public-tracker copy validation are in progress."
  "2026-10-22T15:32:27.299Z",codex-agent,"Validation: linked node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/schema-drift.test.ts passed 44/44 through pm test --run --progress. Targeted transport/schema retest passed 6/6. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run docstring and git diff --check passed. Behavioral revert proof: disabling only the schemaVersion comparison made deleted-label and renamed-state tests fail 2/2; disabling only sync metadata negotiation made GraphQL-denial and hidden-team tests fail 2/2. Restored production functions after each probe. Public main tracker copy: 100 certified items, 208 source files, 6 local statuses, 66 distinct tag/fixture labels; atomic preview 100 creates/0 updates/0 writes, report 946 JSON bytes/733 TOON bytes, 6 metadata requests/1 issue request, 620 ms, zero copied source changes. Synthetic deleted-label, renamed-state and permission controls all refused. This is real local-data acceptance with a synthetic provider, not live Linear account validation. Details in docs/schema-negotiation.md. Full npm/Bun release gates are delegated to CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-22T15:38:38.244Z",codex-agent,"Review PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/163 (ready, not draft). Related canonical terminal mapping defect is tracked and fixed in pm-linear-canonical-terminal-states, with 3/3 passing regressions and a 3/3 failing mapper revert. Fresh public-copy rerun after mapper correction retained the same 100 items/208 unchanged files/6 statuses/66 labels, 946 JSON/733 TOON bytes, 6 metadata/1 issue requests and all three refusal controls; elapsed 2120 ms. Registry CLI is 2026.10.22; retained the repository-pinned 2026.10.15 per queue policy. Local strict health is not a pass: host-specific global pm-github version skew and the inherited generated merge fence differ from the pinned setup. No merge-driver work was undertaken. CI fresh-checkout health and explicit npm/Bun gates remain pending; no health or reviewer approval is inferred."
  "2026-10-22T15:44:47.245Z",codex-agent,"First full CI gate run 39806898979 executed 323 tests per runtime: 321 passed and 2 integration failures. Coverage met unchanged thresholds (99.69 percent lines, 96.91 percent branches, 100 percent functions). Fixed both findings: schema-version is now declared in each command's existing flag set (one registerFlags registration per importer), and the runtime matrix uses explicit conditional npm/Bun commands so publish attestation can prove the executable. Targeted activation/workflow regressions now pass 2/2; publish-attestation verifier, typecheck and docstring lint pass. Fresh-checkout Node 22 health passed, distinguishing the earlier host-only health findings. Full npm/Bun gates must rerun before completion."
  "2026-10-22T15:54:15.360Z",codex-agent,"Implementation gate evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/39807792715 at commit 4a6758f8e4170ce51e6dfb71b8ca8a7370dd5f7d passed all 4 jobs. npm run release:check: 323/323 tests, 0 failures. bun run release:check: 323/323 tests, 0 failures. Node 22 and Node 26 CI: 323/323 each, fresh-checkout strict health passed. npm/Bun source coverage: 99.69 percent lines, 96.90 percent branches, 100 percent functions at unchanged 99/96/100 thresholds; production audit 0 vulnerabilities; typecheck, docstrings, pack, changelog/date and publish attestation passed. The schema suite now includes 47 regressions including the 3 canonical-terminal controls. Raw public-data counts/hash are linked in docs/schema-negotiation-validation.json. PR 163 remains ready and unmerged. Remaining limitations: synthetic provider acceptance rather than live Linear; no provider snapshot transaction after the final check. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification; item remains in_progress. Final evidence-only head will rerun CI and its receipt will be in the PR."
  "2026-10-22T17:38:43.613Z",codex-agent,"Review round for PR 163: fetched every unresolved thread and all comments; review pagination complete, no outside-diff findings in latest CodeRabbit review. Remote head 43cdac73554b29acff475dbd2f4ad213cf0a3c6b pulled; main is already an ancestor (no behind commits). Valid findings: PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6vTfbF SDK example must accept a separately reviewed version; PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6vTfbK preserve only fixed safe endpoint-validation diagnostics; PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6vTfbX replace all four digest-input localeCompare sorts with code-unit ordering. Reusing this item; canonical terminal-state item remains verified and unclaimed. Plan: actual documented-example execution against a real no-git tracker, safe diagnostic/redaction controls, and cross-locale child-process negotiation against real SDK state, plus behavioral revert proofs. No thread replies or resolution mutations."
  "2026-10-22T17:42:51.616Z",codex-agent,"Review fixes and behavioral proof complete. F: documented importReviewedTeam now accepts the persisted reviewed version; discovery is a separate function/invocation. Its actual Markdown example executes against a real no-git SDK tracker: reverting only that apply function causes 1/1 regression to fail. K: exact-match allowlist exposes only the resolver's two fixed endpoint diagnostics; malformed/non-loopback endpoints preserve actionable causes while arbitrary response/query secrets stay redacted. Reverting only negotiateLinearSchema causes both diagnostic tests to fail (2/2). X: shared UTF-16 comparator covers all four digest sorts. Real English/Swedish Node processes with Unicode states, labels, overrides and SDK-created statuses produce identical reports/digests. Reverting only negotiateLinearSchema fails the locale regression 1/1; separately reverting only readSchemaStatuses also fails it 1/1. All production functions restored, targeted review controls pass 5/5. Full PR diff self-review checked every added sort, schema-version/discovery call and exception boundary: remaining transaction sorts are already code-unit ordered, no duplicate defect instance found. Typecheck, test typecheck, docstring lint and whitespace checks pass. No review-thread reply or resolution action taken."
  "2026-10-22T17:48:51.586Z",codex-agent,"Review round CI complete: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/39825310519 at c430b7e0c49acbf5fef9c96bb7280b27382e0476 passed all 4 jobs. npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed 328/328 tests, 0 failures; Node 22 and Node 26 checks passed too. Coverage 99.69 percent lines, 97.05 percent branches, 100 percent functions at unchanged 99/96/100 thresholds. Fresh-checkout health, audit (0 vulnerabilities), package contents, changelog/date and publish attestation passed. Local pm test --run --progress ran the complete schema suite: 52/52 pass; review-only controls 5/5 pass. No local timeout or load-related retry was needed. Thread mapping: PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6vTfbF fixed reviewed-version example (function revert 1/1 fails); PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6vTfbK fixed safe endpoint diagnostics (negotiation revert 2/2 fails); PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6vTfbX fixed all locale-sensitive sorts (negotiation revert 1/1 and status-reader revert 1/1 fail separately). All fixes valid, no outside-diff findings; whole-PR same-class review found no additional instances. Releasing claim and leaving item in_progress for orchestrator verification. Final evidence-only head will rerun CI; final run URL and head will be in PR 163. No thread mutation, merge or release action taken."
